{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-gateway","title":"支付网关架构与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-gateway","wordCount":1374,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"支付网关架构与集成\">支付网关架构与集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>支付网关是电商平台与金融网络之间的技术桥梁，负责交易信息的加密传输、路由分发、协议转换和状态管理。现代支付网关已从简单的通道转发演进为集成智能路由、风控引擎、令牌管理和商户仪表盘的综合平台。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[电商收银台] --&gt; B[支付网关 API]&#10;    B --&gt; C{智能路由引擎}&#10;    C --&gt; D[通道A: 银联]&#10;    C --&gt; E[通道B: Visa/MC]&#10;    C --&gt; F[通道C: 支付宝]&#10;    C --&gt; G[通道D: 本地银行]&#10;    B --&gt; H[令牌库]&#10;    B --&gt; I[风控引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; J[对账系统]&#10;    D --&gt; K[清算网络]&#10;    E --&gt; K&#10;    F --&gt; K&#10;    G --&gt; K\">graph TB\n    A[电商收银台] --&gt; B[支付网关 API]\n    B --&gt; C{智能路由引擎}\n    C --&gt; D[通道A: 银联]\n    C --&gt; E[通道B: Visa/MC]\n    C --&gt; F[通道C: 支付宝]\n    C --&gt; G[通道D: 本地银行]\n    B --&gt; H[令牌库]\n    B --&gt; I[风控引擎]\n    B --&gt; J[对账系统]\n    D --&gt; K[清算网络]\n    E --&gt; K\n    F --&gt; K\n    G --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网关类型</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>适用商户</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全托管网关</td>\n<td>Stripe、PayPal</td>\n<td>中小商户</td>\n<td>开箱即用，收银台预置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 优先网关</td>\n<td>Adyen、Braintree</td>\n<td>中大型商户</td>\n<td>高度可定制，无UI限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合网关</td>\n<td>收钱吧、Payoneer</td>\n<td>线下+线上</td>\n<td>多渠道聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行网关</td>\n<td>各银行直连</td>\n<td>大型企业</td>\n<td>费率最低，对接复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网关架构设计\">网关架构设计</h2><p>一个生产级支付网关的核心模块包括：API 层（接收和验证请求）、路由层（选择最优通道）、通道适配层（协议转换）、异步通知层（处理回调）、对账层（资金核对）。</p>\n<p>API 层需要处理幂等性、签名验证和请求限流。幂等性通过商户传入的 <code>idempotencyKey</code> 实现——同一个 Key 的重复请求返回相同结果而不会重复扣款。签名通常采用 HMAC-SHA256 或 RSA-SHA256，请求体参与签名计算防止篡改。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GatewayConfig {&#10;  apiVersion: &#39;v2&#39;;&#10;  authentication: {&#10;    type: &#39;api_key&#39; | &#39;oauth2&#39; | &#39;hmac&#39;;&#10;    publicKey: string;&#10;    webhookSecret: string;&#10;  };&#10;  retry: {&#10;    maxAttempts: 3;&#10;    backoffMultiplier: 2;&#10;    retryableErrors: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  timeout: {&#10;    connect: 5000;&#10;    read: 30000;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const verifyWebhookSignature = (payload: string, signature: string, secret: string): boolean =&gt; {&#10;  const computed = crypto.createHmac(&#39;sha256&#39;, secret).update(payload).digest(&#39;hex&#39;);&#10;  return crypto.timingSafeEqual(Buffer.from(computed), Buffer.from(signature));&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GatewayConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'v2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  authentication</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api_key'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'oauth2'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hmac'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    publicKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    webhookSecret</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxAttempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backoffMultiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    retryableErrors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    connect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    read</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> verifyWebhookSignature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">signature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">secret</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createHmac</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, secret).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timingSafeEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(computed), Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(signature));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通道适配层是网关架构中最复杂的部分。每个支付通道有不同的 API 规范、加密要求和报文格式。适配器模式（Adapter Pattern）将通道差异封装在独立模块中，统一对上层暴露标准化接口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计模式</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适配器模式</td>\n<td>统一通道接口</td>\n<td>StripeAdapter、AlipayAdapter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略模式</td>\n<td>路由算法切换</td>\n<td>CostBasedRouter、SuccessRateRouter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察者模式</td>\n<td>异步事件通知</td>\n<td>PaymentSuccessEvent → 订单/库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态机模式</td>\n<td>交易状态管理</td>\n<td>created → authorized → captured → settled</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试模式</td>\n<td>故障恢复</td>\n<td>指数退避 + 幂等保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"智能路由引擎\">智能路由引擎</h2><p>智能路由是现代支付网关的核心竞争力。路由引擎根据交易特征（金额、币种、卡 BIN、用户地区）和通道状态（成功率、延迟、费率、限额）动态选择最优支付通道。</p>\n<p>路由策略的优先级通常为：可用性 &gt; 成功率 &gt; 费率 &gt; 延迟。当主通道故障时，路由引擎自动降级到备用通道（Failover）；当主通道成功率下降超过阈值时，流量渐进切换到表现更好的通道（Circuit Breaker + Gradual Shift）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RoutingRule {&#10;  conditions: {&#10;    currency?: string[];&#10;    cardBrand?: (&#39;visa&#39; | &#39;mastercard&#39; | &#39;amex&#39;)[];&#10;    amountRange?: { min: number; max: number };&#10;    country?: string[];&#10;    riskLevel?: (&#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;)[];&#10;  };&#10;  channels: {&#10;    channelId: string;&#10;    weight: number;&#10;    priority: number;&#10;    maxDailyVolume?: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  fallbackChannelId: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ChannelHealth {&#10;  channelId: string;&#10;  successRate: number;&#10;  averageLatency: number;&#10;  p99Latency: number;&#10;  failureCount: number;&#10;  circuitBreakerState: &#39;closed&#39; | &#39;open&#39; | &#39;half_open&#39;;&#10;  lastHealthCheck: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoutingRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  conditions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cardBrand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'visa'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mastercard'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'amex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    amountRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    country</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    riskLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    channelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxDailyVolume</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fallbackChannelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChannelHealth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  successRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  averageLatency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  p99Latency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  failureCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  circuitBreakerState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'half_open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastHealthCheck</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>级联重试（Cascading Retry）是提升整体支付成功率的重要手段。当首选通道返回可重试错误码（如网络超时、通道限流）时，路由引擎自动将请求转发到次选通道。需要注意区分可重试错误（Retryable）和终态错误（Terminal）——余额不足、卡过期等错误不应重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收银台集成方案\">收银台集成方案</h2><p>电商平台与支付网关的集成方式影响用户体验、安全合规和开发效率。主流集成方案包括托管收银台（Hosted Checkout）、嵌入式组件（Embedded Components）和纯 API 集成三种。</p>\n<p>托管收银台将用户重定向到支付网关的支付页面，所有敏感数据在网关侧处理，商户无需处理卡信息，PCI 合规负担最小（SAQ A）。缺点是品牌连续性差，跳转可能增加流失率。</p>\n<p>嵌入式组件（如 Stripe Elements、Adyen Drop-in）在商户页面内渲染安全的 iframe 输入框，兼顾安全性和用户体验。卡号输入框运行在独立的安全域内，商户页面无法访问其中的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CheckoutSessionConfig {&#10;  mode: &#39;hosted&#39; | &#39;embedded&#39; | &#39;api&#39;;&#10;  paymentMethods: string[];&#10;  amount: number;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  returnUrl: string;&#10;  appearance: {&#10;    theme: &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39; | &#39;auto&#39;;&#10;    borderRadius: string;&#10;    fontFamily: string;&#10;    primaryColor: string;&#10;  };&#10;  features: {&#10;    saveCard: boolean;&#10;    addressCollection: &#39;auto&#39; | &#39;required&#39; | &#39;never&#39;;&#10;    walletButtons: (&#39;apple_pay&#39; | &#39;google_pay&#39;)[];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckoutSessionConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hosted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'embedded'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentMethods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  returnUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  appearance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'light'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dark'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    borderRadius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fontFamily</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    primaryColor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  features</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    saveCard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    addressCollection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'required'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'never'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    walletButtons</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apple_pay'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'google_pay'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集成方案</th>\n<th>PCI 合规等级</th>\n<th>开发周期</th>\n<th>品牌控制</th>\n<th>转化率影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>托管收银台</td>\n<td>SAQ A（最低）</td>\n<td>1-3天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>-5~10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式组件</td>\n<td>SAQ A-EP</td>\n<td>1-2周</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯API集成</td>\n<td>SAQ D（最高）</td>\n<td>2-4周</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>+2~5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"webhook-与异步通知\">Webhook 与异步通知</h2><p>支付交易的最终状态通过 Webhook 异步通知商户系统。网关在交易状态变更时向商户预注册的 URL 发送 HTTP POST 请求，携带签名和交易详情。商户系统必须在收到通知后正确验签并返回 200 状态码，否则网关会按退避策略重试。</p>\n<p>Webhook 处理的关键设计原则：幂等性（同一事件可能多次送达）、顺序无关性（不依赖通知到达顺序）、快速响应（在 5 秒内返回，耗时操作异步处理）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WebhookEvent {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  type: &#39;payment.authorized&#39; | &#39;payment.captured&#39; | &#39;payment.failed&#39; | &#39;refund.completed&#39;;&#10;  created: number;&#10;  data: {&#10;    paymentId: string;&#10;    amount: number;&#10;    currency: string;&#10;    status: string;&#10;    metadata: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;  deliveryAttempt: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const RETRY_SCHEDULE = [0, 60, 300, 3600, 7200, 21600, 43200, 86400] as const;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebhookEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payment.authorized'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payment.captured'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payment.failed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refund.completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  created</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    paymentId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deliveryAttempt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RETRY_SCHEDULE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">43200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生产环境中还需实现 Webhook 事件的本地持久化和重放机制。将收到的所有事件存入消息队列或数据库，由后台消费者处理业务逻辑。即使处理失败也不会丢失事件，可以手动重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>支付网关架构核心模块：API层（幂等+签名）、路由层（智能选通道）、适配层（协议转换）、通知层（Webhook）、对账层</li>\n<li>智能路由根据成功率、费率、延迟动态选择通道，级联重试可提升整体成功率 3-8%</li>\n<li>集成方案从托管收银台到纯 API 逐步提升品牌控制力，但 PCI 合规负担也随之增大</li>\n<li>Webhook 处理必须保证幂等性和快速响应，异步消费 + 本地持久化是生产最佳实践</li>\n<li>选择支付网关应评估：通道覆盖范围、API 设计质量、文档完备性、SDK 支持、仪表盘功能和技术支持响应速度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"支付网关架构与集成","id":"支付网关架构与集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网关架构设计","id":"网关架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"智能路由引擎","id":"智能路由引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"收银台集成方案","id":"收银台集成方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Webhook 与异步通知","id":"webhook-与异步通知"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电商支付方式全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-methods"},"next":{"title":"支付安全体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-security"}}